        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Sequel to Shikigami no Shiro, SS2 is a vertical-scrolling shooter with sci-fi elements.\n\nAs in most games in the genre, the game puts you in control of a small fighter as you attempt to make your way past several stages filled with enemy ships charging and attacking you in different patterns.\n\nThe game features 7 distinct characters with psychic powers (which manifest in-game as bomb-type attacks and other special moves) and unique fighters, and the game features a story mode for each character, in which they have different dialogue and plot-sequences for each boss fight.\n\nAlso included is a weapon system similar to Psyvariar's in which you can enhance your power and rate of fire by scraping incoming bullets.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
